A good place to download the original source of PC Hack 3.61 is here:

http://www.juiblex.co.uk/nethack/source.html

There are no gameplay differences between my version and the one
available there.

My decision to only distribute binaries from my web site is mostly
because of the limited storage and bandwidth I am allowed each month
(as it is a free host), and the amount of work involved in keeping it
all up-to-date.

Another point that must be considered is that the game was forever
spoiled for me as I was working on it at the source code level; there
are aspects of Hack that are fun to discover by accident while
exploring. I wanted to preserve this for as many new players as
possible. The sheer size of NetHack's source, on the other hand,
diminishes this effect greatly.

